  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Set air fryer to 200°C. Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into 1cm chunks.\n• Place croutons into an air fryer basket and cook, until golden and slightly crisp, 2-3 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl.\n• In a medium bowl, combine Aussie spice blend, plant-based crumbed chicken and a drizzle of olive oil, turning chicken to coat.\n• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat. Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea40cfc617b70a129fdd2-b082c8b1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Finely shred baby cos lettuce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea40cfc617b70a129fdd2-8b906379.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine dill & parsley mayonnaise, a drizzle of olive oil and a splash of water.\n• Add baby cos lettuce, cucumber, spinach and slightly cooled croutons. Season, then toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea40cfc617b70a129fdd2-98895776.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy slaw between plates. Top with Aussie plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Pour over any juices from the oven tray to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea40cfc617b70a129fdd2-bd8dc167.jpeg"
    }
  ]
